{"id":543,"date":"2022-10-10T10:52:50","date_gmt":"2022-10-10T01:22:50","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/?p=543"},"modified":"2022-10-10T12:29:52","modified_gmt":"2022-10-10T02:59:52","slug":"google-product-category-optimizations","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/google-product-category-optimizations\/","title":{"rendered":"New Feature: Google Product Category Optimizations"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"543\" class=\"elementor elementor-543\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-0514554 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"0514554\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-710eb55\" data-id=\"710eb55\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-05564c0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"05564c0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-size: 1rem;\">Today we have released a new feature that allows you to optimize Google Product Category at the product level, giving you more flexibility than ever before in how you optimize your product data within FeedOps.<\/span><\/p><p>The Google Product Category [google_product_category] attribute is used to categorize an item. This category is selected from the Google\u2019s taxonomy. Placing products in product categories is designed to help potential customers navigate their way to your product. This makes it paramount that you select the correct category for your product. Otherwise, you may end up with customers struggling to find what they are looking for.<\/p><p>Optimizing your Google Product Category at the category level is still available at FeedOps &gt; Websites &gt; Categories page.<\/p><p>Optimizing at the category level allows the optimizations to flow through new products while taking the category hierarchy into consideration.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-34936ef\" data-id=\"34936ef\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b690b09 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"b690b09\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"686\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/Editing-Google-Product-Category-at-Product-Level.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-545\" alt=\"Optimizing Google Product Category at Product Level\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/Editing-Google-Product-Category-at-Product-Level.png 1000w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/Editing-Google-Product-Category-at-Product-Level-300x257.png 300w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/Editing-Google-Product-Category-at-Product-Level-768x659.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-54acd07 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"54acd07\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-86ac016\" data-id=\"86ac016\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fd1d815 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"fd1d815\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">How to optimize your Google Product Category at the product level.<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0ce9926 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0ce9926\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">1: Go to Website &gt; Channel &gt; Products<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2: Go to the Columns Selection &gt; Product Categorization &gt; Google Product Category<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-99dcaf3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"99dcaf3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"442\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/Google-Product-Category-1024x566.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-547\" alt=\"Select Google Product Category\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/Google-Product-Category-1024x566.png 1024w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/Google-Product-Category-300x166.png 300w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/Google-Product-Category-768x425.png 768w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/Google-Product-Category.png 1147w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\"><\/figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a657ec8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a657ec8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">3: Select the products that you want to edit and then update the Google Product Category.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-5d27d10 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"5d27d10\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-3f4630d\" data-id=\"3f4630d\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-862b322 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"862b322\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"289\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/Edit-Products-1024x370.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-548\" alt=\"Edit Products\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/Edit-Products-1024x370.png 1024w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/Edit-Products-300x108.png 300w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/Edit-Products-768x277.png 768w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/Edit-Products-1536x555.png 1536w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/Edit-Products.png 1614w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-85c2d0b\" data-id=\"85c2d0b\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-af1bcf9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"af1bcf9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"686\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/Editing-Google-Product-Category-at-Product-Level.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-545\" alt=\"Optimizing Google Product Category at Product Level\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/Editing-Google-Product-Category-at-Product-Level.png 1000w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/Editing-Google-Product-Category-at-Product-Level-300x257.png 300w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/Editing-Google-Product-Category-at-Product-Level-768x659.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d3b9cf8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d3b9cf8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">NOTE: You also have the option to optimize the Google Product Category at the category level.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">4: After applying your mappings, click the \u201cSave\u201d\u00a0 &amp; \u201cPublish\u201d buttons.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Please note that it might take some time (maximum a day) for your optimizations to flow through Google\/Facebook\/Microsoft (depending on your inventory size) from FeedOps.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-c7f596b elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"c7f596b\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-d758204\" data-id=\"d758204\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cfb9ac4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"cfb9ac4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Other changes<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6a1e262 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6a1e262\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">One other minor change with this release is that you can still optimize the Google Product Category at the category level, and while generating your feed, FeedOps will take into consideration optimizations applied at the product level over the category level.<\/span><\/p><p>The hierarchy that FeedOps will follow: Product Optimizations &gt; Category Optimizations.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bae82f5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"bae82f5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"355\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/Editing-Google-Product-Category-at-Category-Level-1024x455.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-546\" alt=\"Optimizing Google Product Category at Category Level\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/Editing-Google-Product-Category-at-Category-Level-1024x455.png 1024w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/Editing-Google-Product-Category-at-Category-Level-300x133.png 300w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/Editing-Google-Product-Category-at-Category-Level-768x341.png 768w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/Editing-Google-Product-Category-at-Category-Level-1536x683.png 1536w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/10\/Editing-Google-Product-Category-at-Category-Level.png 1921w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>FeedOps allows you to optimize the Google Product Category at both category &#038; product level, giving you the flexibility to advertise the way you want.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":537,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-543","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-uncategorized"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.6 (Yoast SEO v26.6) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>New Feature: Google Product Category Optimizations<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"FeedOps allows you to optimize the Google Product Category, giving you the flexibility to advertise the way you want.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/google-product-category-optimizations\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"New Feature: Google Product Category Optimizations\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"FeedOps allows you to optimize the Google Product Category, giving you the flexibility to advertise the way you want.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/google-product-category-optimizations\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"FeedOps\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/feedops\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2022-10-10T01:22:50+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2022-10-10T02:59:52+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/pexels-pixabay-257736-scaled.jpg\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"2560\" \/>\n\t<meta